      "level": {
        "value": 13
      },
      "privateNotes": "<p>Oster should attempt to use his Mega Bomb when he can hit as many PCs as possible without hitting any of his allies; if he rolls well on initiative, his first turn is opportune for this. His Pyromaniac ability gives his HP some significant heft, so he shouldn't be adverse to fighting on the front lines.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Symbols'\">Oster is a Maw recreation of Donkla (goblin alchemist), who once served as Covalon's Foreman, leader of the Crafting Union. The real Donkla was unfortunately slain battling a Maw fascimile in Ratchethallow, but Covalonians remember his brave spirit, along with his fiery alchemical inventions. Oster is the head of urban development in Taltain, but it is rumored he simply burns down any districts he doesn't like, to build them anew.</span></p>",
